        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "One of the primary design goals within this document is to provide the means to coordinate activities on the two sides of the charging cable. For the scheduled control mode, where power schedules are negotiated which then define future behavior, this leads to the necessity of a concept of coordinated time.",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                1290,
                1054,
                1370
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    68.0,
                    1290.0
                ],
                [
                    1054.0,
                    1290.0
                ],
                [
                    1054.0,
                    1370.0
                ],
                [
                    68.0,
                    1370.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In addition, it is necessary to ensure the validity of certificates or to coordinate activities based on power or price schedules which have been created by external secondary actors outside the local communication network. So a clear definition of a relationship to coordinated universal time (UTC) is required.",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                1391,
                1055,
                1496
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    68.0,
                    1391.0
                ],
                [
                    1055.0,
                    1391.0
                ],
                [
                    1055.0,
                    1496.0
                ],
                [
                    68.0,
                    1496.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "While time appears like a trivial issue there are a number of technical requirements that need to be satisfied within this context. Besides the regular questions of the handling of leap seconds, time zones",
